<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n67732" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μικρο-λόγος</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σμικρ-</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>counting trifles, careful about trifles</i>;
			and so, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			<i>caring about petty expenses, penurious</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				59.36
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Char.</u>
				10.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hyp.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				255
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σὺ δὲ μ. ἄρ᾽ οὐ θέλων
				καινὰς πρίασθαι</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμβάδας</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				109.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>cavilling about trifles, captious</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. καὶ μεμψίμοιρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Isoc.
					12.8
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. καὶ μικρολύπους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.171b
				</span></i>
			; <i>petty</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Smp.</u>
				210d
			</span></i>. Adv. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γως</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.730b
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
